\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces MediTrack system architecture showing the four-layer MVVM design with Firebase infrastructure. The Presentation Layer contains 33 Activities driven by 22 ViewModels. The Domain Layer houses use cases for complex multi-repository orchestration. The Data Layer comprises 14 repositories and the analytics pipeline. The Infrastructure Layer is built on Firebase services with 540-line server-side security rules.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{MediTrack system architecture showing the four-layer MVVM design with Firebase infrastructure. The Presentation Layer contains 33 Activities driven by 22 ViewModels. The Domain Layer houses use cases for complex multi-repository orchestration. The Data Layer comprises 14 repositories and the analytics pipeline. The Infrastructure Layer is built on Firebase services with 540-line server-side security rules}{figure.1}{}}
