\newlabel{fig:analytics}{{4}{7}{On-device health analytics pipeline architecture. The {\tt InsightEngine} facade coordinates the {\tt RiskScoreEngine} (composite 0--100 scoring), {\tt TrendPredictionEngine} (consecutive pattern detection with linear regression), and {\tt VitalAlertEngine} (threshold-based vital alerts). Outputs are unified by the {\tt UnifiedAlertPrioritizer} and fed to the {\tt HealthInsightEngine} for personalized suggestion generation}{figure.4}{}}
